    "text": "© 2026 SaturdayDownSouth.com Home > News > Sports > How to Watch Arkansas vs High Point: TV Channel & Tip-Off Time for the Razorbacks & Panthers Matchup Ad Disclosure This article/post contains references to products or services from one or more of our advertisers or partners. We may receive compensation when you click on links to those products or services. The No. 4 seed Arkansas Razorbacks face the No. 12 seed High Point Panthers in the second round of the 2026 NCAA Men’s Basketball Tournament. Arkansas enters with a 27-8 record following a 97-78 first-round victory over Hawaii. Head coach John Calipari secured his 60th career tournament win in that matchup. Watch Arkansas vs High Point on Sling TV. High Point enters this game at 31-4 under coach Flynn Clayman. The Panthers recently secured their first tournament win by defeating Wisconsin 83-82. Chase Johnston hit the decisive layup in the final seconds to advance his team. This contest pairs a Southeastern Conference champion with a Big South Conference champion. Fans looking to follow this game will find everything they need right here. Continue reading for the official tip-off time, the neutral site location, the live television channel, and the available streaming options. Matchup Preview and Market Outlook Fans wanting to turn their basketball knowledge into a tradable opportunity can look to Kalshi for this second-round game. Prediction markets allow you to take a position on the exact outcome of the matchup. High Point presents a unique challenge with their scoring pace, but Arkansas brings significant size and tournament experience. On Kalshi, you can weigh these factors and trade on which team advances to the next round. Engaging with the market provides a direct way to quantify your expectations for the Razorbacks and Panthers. When is Arkansas vs High Point? What Time Does It Start? The postseason matchup between the Arkansas Razorbacks and High Point Panthers takes place on March 21, 2026. Tip-off is scheduled for 9:45 PM ET. The local start time in the Pacific timezone is 6:45 PM PT. Where is Arkansas vs High Point? The game between the Arkansas Razorbacks and the High Point Panthers happens at the Moda Center. This venue is located in Portland, Oregon. Because this game takes place at a neutral site during the tournament, the teams receive specific designations. The Arkansas Razorbacks serve as the designated home team. The High Point Panthers operate as the designated away team. How Can I Watch Arkansas vs High Point? Fans wanting to watch the matchup between the Arkansas Razorbacks and the High Point Panthers can tune in on standard television. TBS provides the exclusive national broadcast for this game. How Can I Stream Arkansas vs High Point? Viewers have several digital options to stream the matchup between the Arkansas Razorbacks and the High Point Panthers. The broadcast is available directly on the TBS app and website for fans who log in with a participating TV provider. Subscribers to HBO Max can also stream the game live using the B/R Sports Add-On. If you do not have a traditional cable package, multiple live TV streaming services carry TBS. Fans can stream the action using platforms like YouTube TV, Hulu + Live TV, DIRECTV STREAM, and Sling TV. Who Will Win? Arkansas vs High Point Data from Kalshi on March 20th. Based on the current prediction market data from Kalshi, the Arkansas Razorbacks are the most likely team to win this game. Arkansas holds an implied win probability of 85.0 percent to advance. The High Point Panthers have a 15.0 percent implied win probability. The data suggests Arkansas possesses a distinct advantage, though High Point retains a quantifiable path to victory in this matchup. Creative Manager and Writer at Sportradar. Craig has previously worked as a camera operator and video director in radio and television, as well as a content coordinator in the non-profit sector. You might also like...",
